  {%- comment -%}
    Palette test: the page type is on the body, and the theme's colour tokens
    are redefined per type in shemakes.css. Custom properties inherit, so one
    attribute repaints everything on the page, app widgets included.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <body class="gradient" data-sm-palette="{{ request.page_type }}">
    <a class="skip-to-content-link button visually-hidden" href="#MainContent">
      {{ 'accessibility.skip_to_text' | t }}
    </a>

    {%- comment -%}
      SHEmakes: the cart side panel. No Liquid fallback on purpose — with no
      JavaScript the header's cart button is still a plain link to /cart, which
      is the whole cart page, so an empty panel would only be in the way.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- capture drawer_props -%}
{
  "threshold": {{ settings.sm_free_shipping_threshold | default: 15000 }},
  "currency": {{ cart.currency.iso_code | json }},
  "checkoutUrl": {{ routes.cart_url | append: '/checkout' | json }},
  {%- comment -%}
    "Add these too" picks for itself unless the shop names a collection here,
    in Theme settings. Named, these are the products and nothing else decides;
    left empty, Shopify's own recommendations do — the shop's complementary
    list first, and what Shopify works out after that.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  "upsell": [
    {%- assign upsell_source = collections[settings.sm_upsell_collection] -%}
    {%- for product in upsell_source.products limit: 8 -%}
      {%- unless product.available == false -%}
        {% unless forloop.first %},{% endunless %}
        {
          "id": {{ product.id }},
          "title": {{ product.title | json }},
          "url": {{ product.url | json }},
          "price": {{ product.price }},
          "featured_image": {{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 200 | json }},
          "variantId": {{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}
        }
      {%- endunless -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  ]
}
    {%- endcapture -%}
    {% render 'sm-island', name: 'cart-drawer', props: drawer_props %}

    {%- comment -%}
      The theme's own drawer is gone. Its CSS and its JavaScript were both
      loaded by sections/header.liquid, which sm-header replaces — so the
      drawer rendered as unstyled block markup at the top of every page (the
      white band above the ticker) and could not be opened. The island above
      replaces it.

      Put the cart-drawer render back here, and the drawer's assets with it,
      only if the header goes back to stock.
    {%- endcomment -%}

    {%- comment -%}
      SHEmakes: one ticker replaces the three announcement bars the theme
      stacked on top of each other. It lives here rather than in the homepage
      template because it belongs on every page, as the old bars did.

      The originals are still in sections/ — put these three lines back to
      return to them.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {% section 'sm-ticker' %}
    {%- comment -%}
      SHEmakes: our own header. Swap back to {% section 'header' %} for stock.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {% section 'sm-header' %}
    <main id="MainContent" class="content-for-layout focus-none" role="main" tabindex="-1">
      {{ content_for_layout }}
    </main>

    {%- comment -%}
      SHEmakes: our own footer, not the theme's. Restyling the theme footer
      with CSS produced a hybrid — its column model, logo block and payment
      icons do not match the approved design. Swap this line back to
      {% section 'footer' %} to return to stock.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {% section 'sm-footer' %}

    <ul hidden>
      <li id="a11y-refresh-page-message">{{ 'accessibility.refresh_page' | t }}</li>
    </ul>

    <script>
      
      
      window.shopUrl = '{{ request.origin }}';
      window.routes = {
        cart_add_url: '{{ routes.cart_add_url }}',
        cart_change_url: '{{ routes.cart_change_url }}',
        cart_update_url: '{{ routes.cart_update_url }}',
        cart_url: '{{ routes.cart_url }}',
        predictive_search_url: '{{ routes.predictive_search_url }}'
      };

      window.cartStrings = {
        error: `{{ 'sections.cart.cart_error' | t }}`,
        quantityError: `{{ 'sections.cart.cart_quantity_error_html' | t: quantity: '[quantity]' }}`
      }

      window.variantStrings = {
        addToCart: `{{ 'products.product.add_to_cart' | t }}`,
        soldOut: `{{ 'products.product.sold_out' | t }}`,
        unavailable: `{{ 'products.product.unavailable' | t }}`,
      }

      window.accessibilityStrings = {
        imageAvailable: `{{ 'products.product.media.image_available' | t: index: '[index]' }}`,
        shareSuccess: `{{ 'general.share.success_message' | t }}`,
        pauseSlideshow: `{{ 'sections.slideshow.pause_slideshow' | t }}`,
        playSlideshow: `{{ 'sections.slideshow.play_slideshow' | t }}`,
      }


    </script>

    {%- if settings.predictive_search_enabled -%}
      <script src="{{ 'predictive-search.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
    {%- endif -%}

    <script src="{{ 'jquery-cookie.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

    {% if settings.enable_newsletter_popup %}
      {% section 'newsletter-popup' %}
    {% endif %}

    {%- include 'product-notification-popup' -%}
    
  {% render 'uploadkit' %}
    <style>
      span.price-item.price-item--regular {
    color: {{ settings.final_price_color }}!important;
   {% if settings.final_price_weight %}
        font-weight: bold!important;
     {% else %}
        font-weight: 400!important;
     {% endif %}
}
      .price-item--sale{
        color: {{ settings.compare_price_color }}!important;
   {% if settings.compare_price_weight %}
        font-weight: bold!important;
     {% else %}
        font-weight: 400!important;
     {% endif %}
      }
    </style>
    {% render 'sm-discount-tab' %}
</body>
</html>
